Descriptor GradeLevel
    documentation 'This descriptor defines the set of grade levels. The map to known Ed-Fi enumeration 
                  'values is required.
    with map type
        item Adult Education
        item Early Education
        item Eighth grade
        item Eleventh grade
        item Fifth grade
        item First grade
        item Fourth grade
        item Grade 13
        item Infant/toddler
        item Kindergarten
        item Ninth grade
        item Other
        item Postsecondary
        item Preschool/Prekindergarten
        item Second grade
        item Seventh grade
        item Sixth grade
        item Tenth grade
        item Third grade
        item Twelfth grade
        item Ungraded